#ASSERT `sch 13 para 11(1) the transfer or resumption of the function affects the thing previously done` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 13 para 11(1) the transfer or resumption of the function affects the thing previously done` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
